# ===================
# Environment & Secrets
# ===================
# Catches .env, .env.local, .env.dev, .env.production, .env.<anything> —
# config.py loads f".env.{ENV}" for arbitrary ENV values, so any variant can
# hold real credentials. *.example files are templates and stay tracked.
.env
.env.*
!.env*.example
*.local.env
.envrc
.env.production.example

